@startuml 03_system_context
title myJob Recruiting Suite — System Context (UML)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
left to right direction

actor "Recruiter /\nAdmin" as Recruiter
actor "Candidate\n(data subject)" as Candidate
actor "External app" as Ext

rectangle "myJob Recruiting Suite" as System {
  component "REST API\n/api/v1\n(OpenAPI + Swagger UI at /docs)" as API
  component "Recruiting Workspace\n(Vite/React, self-hosted assets)" as UI
}

cloud "LLM providers\nClaude - Gemini\n(per-user keys, optional)" as LLM
cloud "Job boards\nArbeitnow - Bundesagentur - Adzuna\n(optional; offline sample otherwise)" as Jobs
node "SMTP mailer\n(verification - password reset)" as Mail
node "Headless Chromium\n(Puppeteer, PDF render)" as Chromium
database "Store\nFilesystem (default)\nor Postgres (STORE=sql)" as Store

Recruiter --> UI : runs the desk\n(browser, session cookie)
UI --> API : HTTP/JSON, same origin
Ext --> API : integrates (HTTP/JSON,\nsee /api/v1/docs)
Candidate ..> API : data subject of\nexport / erasure / retention

API --> LLM : generate (parse, ATS, pitch,\noutreach, translate, kits, prep)
API --> Jobs : search postings
API --> Mail : send verification / reset links
API --> Chromium : render HTML -> PDF\n(documents, dossier)
API --> Store : persist (repositories\nbehind ports)

@enduml
